%% Authors: [Your name]
%% Scope: SocialU / Backend API / Profile Management.
%% Scenario: authenticated student has no profile, creates one, then edits it.
%% Creation and editing show the successful path after the same authentication checks.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant Page as Profile Page<br/>app/profile/page.tsx
    participant API as Profile API Route<br/>app/api/profile/route.ts
    participant SDK as Supabase SDK<br/>@supabase/supabase-js

    Note over API,SDK: Every request runs getToken(request), getAuthenticatedUser(token), getSupabaseClient(), then auth.getUser(token). Missing/invalid token: 401. Missing configuration: 500.

    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
        Note over Student,SDK: 1 - Load profile
        Student->>Page: Open Profile
        Page->>API: fetchProfile(): GET /api/profile with bearer token
        API->>SDK: auth.getUser(token)
        SDK-->>API: validated user
        API->>SDK: from('myapp_profile').select(...).eq('id', user.id).maybeSingle()
        SDK-->>API: profile or null
        API-->>Page: 200 {profile}
        Page-->>Student: Show profile or create form
        Note right of SDK: No profile yet? GET returns 200 {profile: null}. Query failure: 500.
    end

    rect rgb(255, 252, 242)
        Note over Student,SDK: 2 - Create profile when none exists
        Student->>Page: Submit username and biography
        Page->>API: handleCreate(): POST /api/profile with bearer token
        Note over API,SDK: Repeat token validation before writing.
        API->>SDK: from('myapp_profile').insert({id: user.id, username, biography}).select(...).single()
        SDK-->>API: created profile
        API-->>Page: 201 {profile}
        Page-->>Student: Display saved profile
        Note right of SDK: username is required. User ID comes from the validated token. Validation or database failure: 400.
    end

    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
        Note over Student,SDK: 3 - Edit biography
        Student->>Page: Edit biography, then Save
        Page->>API: handleSave(): PATCH /api/profile with bearer token
        Note over API,SDK: Repeat token validation before writing.
        API->>SDK: from('myapp_profile').update({biography}).eq('id', user.id).select(...).single()
        SDK-->>API: updated profile
        API-->>Page: 200 {profile}
        Page-->>Student: Display new biography
        Note right of SDK: biography must be supplied. Update only the row for user.id. Validation or database failure: 400.
    end
